WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.601
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.267
This is "Late Night." We hope
everybody's doing well tonight.

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:06.000
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.767
President Biden said yesterday

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:11.167
that he plans to deliver
a speech about aid for Ukraine.

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:14.100
And to make sure people tune in,
he promised to go

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.100
no teleprompter.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.767
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:19.033
While leaving
the courtroom yesterday

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:21.033
during the third day
of his civil fraud trial,

00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:23.167
former President Trump
told reporters

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:24.868
he would rather be in Iowa.

00:00:24.868 --> 00:00:28.033
And now he's also facing
one count of perjury.

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:30.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.367 --> 00:00:32.334
According to a new study,
mortgage applications

00:00:32.334 --> 00:00:34.167
have hit a nearly
three-decade low,

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:37.501
which is bad news for people
who just lost their house.

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:38.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:40.400
New York Mayor Eric Adams

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.133
began a four-day tour
of Latin America yesterday

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:45.901
and plans to dissuade migrants
from traveling to the city.

00:00:45.901 --> 00:00:48.100
Apparently, he's gonna do it
by telling them

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:50.167
that he's the mayor.

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:52.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:55.300
In a new interview, Republican
Senator Markwayne Mullin

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:57.367
criticized Florida
Congressman Matt Gaetz

00:00:57.367 --> 00:00:58.734
and said that Gaetz
had bragged

00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:01.067
that he would crush
erectile dysfunction medicine

00:01:01.067 --> 00:01:03.067
and, quote, "chase it
with energy drinks

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:04.400
so he could go all night."

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:05.634
He added...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.634 --> 00:01:07.000
He added that sometimes

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.501
Gaetz would even have
a woman with him.

00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:11.534
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:01:13.267 --> 00:01:14.934
[ Laughter continues ]

00:01:14.934 --> 00:01:16.801
After The New York Times
reported yesterday

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:18.133
that federal prosecutors

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:19.801
are investigating
his drinking habits,

00:01:19.801 --> 00:01:22.067
Rudy Giuliani
told reporters, quote,

00:01:22.067 --> 00:01:24.567
"I do not have
an alcohol problem.

00:01:24.567 --> 00:01:26.267
I have never had
an alcohol problem."

00:01:26.267 --> 00:01:27.467
Rudy, man...

00:01:27.467 --> 00:01:29.033
they're giving you
a perfect excuse.

00:01:29.033 --> 00:01:31.701
Take the off-ramp.

00:01:31.701 --> 00:01:33.701
Do you really want people
to think you helped

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:36.133
an insurrectionist, went
to the wrong Four Seasons,

00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:37.601
leaked hair dye,

00:01:37.601 --> 00:01:40.100
and wore these shorts

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.434
while you were
stone-cold sober?

00:01:42.434 --> 00:01:44.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.467 --> 00:01:45.634
After it was reported...

00:01:45.634 --> 00:01:47.234
They put -- If you wear
those shorts,

00:01:47.234 --> 00:01:50.234
that's a -- that's
a drunk driving test.

00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:52.067
They pull you over and they go,
"You want to put these on?"

00:01:52.067 --> 00:01:53.234
If you're like,
"Yeah, I'll put them on,"

00:01:53.234 --> 00:01:55.901
they're like,
"Get in the car."

00:01:55.901 --> 00:01:57.601
After it was reported
that prosecutors

00:01:57.601 --> 00:01:58.934
are investigating
his drinking habits,

00:01:58.934 --> 00:02:00.701
Rudy Giuliani
told reporters, quote,

00:02:00.701 --> 00:02:02.200
"If I have an alcohol problem,

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.834
I should be in the Guinness
Book of World Records."

00:02:04.834 --> 00:02:07.167
But it turns out
he already is.

00:02:07.167 --> 00:02:09.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.133 --> 00:02:14.434
Russian President Vladimir Putin
turns 71 on Saturday.

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:17.634
He's gonna celebrate
by pushing a cake off a balcony.

00:02:17.634 --> 00:02:19.467
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:02:19.467 --> 00:02:21.467
Ohhhh.

00:02:21.467 --> 00:02:24.300
You guys must love cake.

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:26.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.634 --> 00:02:28.534
In a new statement
about climate change,

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:30.901
Pope Francis criticized
fossil fuel companies

00:02:30.901 --> 00:02:33.100
and said the transition
toward renewable energy

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:36.200
is, quote, "not progressing
at the necessary speed."

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.767
And you know you're in trouble
when the Catholic Church

00:02:38.767 --> 00:02:41.267
thinks you're stuck
in the past.

00:02:41.267 --> 00:02:43.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.267 --> 00:02:44.467
A resident of

00:02:44.467 --> 00:02:46.634
the Florida retirement community
The Villages

00:02:46.634 --> 00:02:48.567
was arrested recently
after he allegedly

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:50.667
stockpiled nearly $2,000 worth

00:02:50.667 --> 00:02:53.033
of erectile dysfunction drugs
to sell,

00:02:53.033 --> 00:02:55.901
continuing the long tradition
of drug dealers yelling,

00:02:55.901 --> 00:02:58.400
"Say hello to my little friend."

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.934 --> 00:03:04.567
And finally, Katmai
National Park in Alaska

00:03:04.567 --> 00:03:07.400
today kicked off its annual
Fat Bear Week contest.

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:10.300
Unfortunately, since they were
all shamed last year,

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.300
they went on Ozempic.

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:14.300
[ Laughter and awws ]

00:03:15.834 --> 00:03:17.934
[ Laughs ]

00:03:17.934 --> 00:03:19.501
That was a monologue, everybody!

00:03:19.501 --> 00:03:20.968
We got a good show
for you tonight.

